# Homelab-vault secrets for Claude sessions, resolved at launch by `aiclaude`
# (.zshrc.functions) via `op run`. References only: no values ever live here.
# Format: NAME=op://Homelab/<item>/<field>  (only the Homelab vault resolves —
# the service account cannot see any other vault)
#  (copy with: op item get <item> --format json)
#
# Move each homelab secret out of .zshrc.sec into a line here, e.g.:
#UNIFI_API_KEY=op://Homelab/UniFi API/credential
#HA_TOKEN=op://Homelab/Home Assistant token/credential
#TANK_SMB_PASSWORD=op://Homelab/tank NAS/password
